2017
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:08,270
Seems to like people, though.

2018
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:12,890
<i>I'm learning more about Kou.</i>

2019
00:20:12,890 --> 00:20:14,230
<i>He hates celery.</i>

2020
00:20:15,150 --> 00:20:16,450
<i>He likes cats.</i>

2021
00:20:17,660 --> 00:20:19,960
<i>He may have a rough way of speaking,</i>

2022
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,780
