2023
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:23,750
<i>...he's gentle.</i>

2024
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,470
My ride's here.

2025
00:20:34,810 --> 00:20:36,850
Guess I'll head back too.

2026
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:38,310
Later.

2027
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:42,260
Kou!

2028
00:20:42,820 --> 00:20:45,180
Thanks for waiting with me.

2029
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:49,140
Huh? I was just playing with that cat.

2030
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:52,330
That's what I thought you'd say!

2031
00:20:53,590 --> 00:20:58,570
<i>He's no longer the Kou I remember. 
Both his voice and height have changed.</i>

2032
00:21:00,650 --> 00:21:02,530
<i>But now I can say I know...</i>

2033
00:21:03,850 --> 00:21:05,290
<i>...the sixteen-year-old Kou.</i>

2034
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:09,490
<i>The one who made my heart skip a beat...</i>

2035
00:21:11,110 --> 00:21:12,870
<i>...was the sixteen-year-old Kou.</i>

2036
